          "id": "1baa96819e20bcba",
          "text": "<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr><th style=\"width:1%;white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">Block</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">What it does</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/click\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">CLICK</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Waits for a person to click ▶, then runs the blocks indented under it.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/tick\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">TICK</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Like CLICK, but runs the blocks under it again and again, up to 99 times.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/until\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">UNTIL</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Sits inside TICK and stops the ticking once a chosen word turns up in the graphs.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/sleep\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">SLEEP</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Waits a number of seconds before the script goes on.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/together\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">TOGETHER</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Starts all the blocks under it at once, instead of one after another.</td></tr>\n</table>"
