          "id": "061f7d7a9bcc2f65",
          "text": "## Pages and neighbors"
        },
        "date": 1791172772910,
        "after": "1baa96819e20bcba"
      },
      {
        "type": "add",
        "id": "32f7bf330c700cd0",
        "item": {
          "type": "html",
          "id": "32f7bf330c700cd0",
          "text": "<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr><th style=\"width:1%;white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">Block</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">What it does</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/from\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">FROM</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Fetches one wiki page so the blocks under it can read it.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/neighbors\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">NEIGHBORS</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Gathers the list of every page on the nearby wiki sites.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/walk\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">WALK</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Follows links through those pages, by steps, days, weeks, hubs or clicks, and keeps what it finds as small graphs.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/random\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">RANDOM</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Picks one page at random from the neighborhood.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/roster\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">ROSTER</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Makes a Roster of the sites in the neighborhood.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/lineup\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">LINEUP</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Makes a list of the pages open to the left of this one.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/show\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">SHOW</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Opens a page beside this one.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/delta\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">DELTA</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Copies another site's recent changes onto this one, working with GET on the server.</td></tr>\n</table>"
        },
        "date": 1791172772911,
        "after": "061f7d7a9bcc2f65"
      },
      {
        "type": "add",
        "id": "bbcdb59cf546d008",
        "item": {
          "type": "markdown",
          "id": "bbcdb59cf546d008",
          "text": "## Data"
        },
        "date": 1791172772912,
        "after": "32f7bf330c700cd0"
      },
      {
        "type": "add",
        "id": "9c34b96c3e534659",
        "item": {
          "type": "html",
          "id": "9c34b96c3e534659",
          "text": "<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr><th style=\"width:1%;white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">Block</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">What it does</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/source\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">SOURCE</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Reads what an item to the left offers, such as map markers, graphs or uploaded files.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/file\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">FILE</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Lets a person pick an uploaded file and hands its text to the blocks under it.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/kwic\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">KWIC</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Builds a keyword-in-context index from a tab-separated file.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/sensor\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">SENSOR</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Reads a temperature from a sensor named on the page.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">CODE</td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Runs a JavaScript function written in a Code item on the same page.</td></tr>\n</table>"
        },
        "date": 1791172772913,
        "after": "bbcdb59cf546d008"
      },
      {
        "type": "add",
        "id": "fd929a6f372a8338",
        "item": {
          "type": "markdown",
          "id": "fd929a6f372a8338",
          "text": "## Show results"
        },
        "date": 1791172772914,
        "after": "9c34b96c3e534659"
      },
      {
        "type": "add",
        "id": "f460c84b77188932",
        "item": {
          "type": "html",
          "id": "f460c84b77188932",
          "text": "<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr><th style=\"width:1%;white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">Block</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">What it does</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/hello\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">HELLO</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Adds a smiling face, the simplest proof that Mech is running.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/report\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">REPORT</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Shows one value, such as a temperature, in large letters.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/preview\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">PREVIEW</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Shows what the script made (graphs, a map, a list or a page) as a new page beside this one.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/popup\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">POPUP</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Opens a pop-up window showing what the script holds, or images.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/solo\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">SOLO</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Opens the script's graphs in the Solo viewer.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/print\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">PRINT</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Gathers the pages a walk found into a printable outline or draft book.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">DOWNLOAD</td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Saves what the script made as a file on your computer.</td></tr>\n</table>"
        },
        "date": 1791172772915,
        "after": "fd929a6f372a8338"
      },
      {
        "type": "add",
        "id": "e58bc399ec1bc0cc",
        "item": {
          "type": "markdown",
          "id": "e58bc399ec1bc0cc",
          "text": "## Server"
        },
        "date": 1791172772916,
        "after": "f460c84b77188932"
      },
      {
        "type": "add",
        "id": "af5f498799cefc3a",
        "item": {
          "type": "html",
          "id": "af5f498799cefc3a",
          "text": "<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr><th style=\"width:1%;white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">Block</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">What it does</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/get\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GET</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Runs the blocks under it on the wiki server and brings back what they make.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/plugin\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">PLUGIN</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Like GET, but another installed plugin answers the blocks under it.</td></tr>\n</table>"
        },
        "date": 1791172772917,
        "after": "e58bc399ec1bc0cc"
      },
      {
        "type": "add",
        "id": "b989fd9eb13a37a4",
        "item": {
          "type": "markdown",
          "id": "b989fd9eb13a37a4",
          "text": "## Messages"
        },
        "date": 1791172772918,
        "after": "af5f498799cefc3a"
      },
      {
        "type": "add",
        "id": "b92b0fac37e4e26b",
        "item": {
          "type": "html",
          "id": "b92b0fac37e4e26b",
          "text": "<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr><th style=\"width:1%;white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">Block</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">What it does</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/listen\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">LISTEN</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Waits for a named message, such as one sent by MESSAGE or by another plugin.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/message\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">MESSAGE</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Sends a named message to the page.</td></tr>\n</table>"
        },
        "date": 1791172772919,
        "after": "b989fd9eb13a37a4"
      },
      {
        "type": "add",
        "id": "c85b872b64f5a6b7",
        "item": {
          "type": "markdown",
          "id": "c85b872b64f5a6b7",
          "text": "## Turtle drawing"
        },
        "date": 1791172772920,
        "after": "b92b0fac37e4e26b"
      },
      {
        "type": "add",
        "id": "36650ae996328ab3",
        "item": {
          "type": "html",
          "id": "36650ae996328ab3",
          "text": "<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr><th style=\"width:1%;white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">Block</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">What it does</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/forward\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">FORWARD</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Moves the drawing turtle forward, drawing a line.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/turn\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">TURN</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Turns the drawing turtle by some degrees.</td></tr>\n</table>"
        },
        "date": 1791172772921,
        "after": "c85b872b64f5a6b7"
      },
      {
        "type": "add",
        "id": "10e9b8d64200b8e8",
        "item": {
          "type": "markdown",
          "id": "10e9b8d64200b8e8",
          "text": "## On the server, inside GET"
        },
        "date": 1791172772922,
        "after": "36650ae996328ab3"
      },
      {
        "type": "add",
        "id": "5213225fe3b9024c",
        "item": {
          "type": "html",
          "id": "5213225fe3b9024c",
          "text": "<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr><th style=\"width:1%;white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">Block</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">What it does</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/hello\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">HELLO</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Sends back a smiling face from the server.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/uptime\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">UPTIME</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Tells how long the server has been running.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/sleep\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">SLEEP</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Waits on the server before going on.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/commons\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">COMMONS</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Counts the image files kept on the server.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><a href=\"http://mech.fed.wiki/view/delta\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">DELTA</a></td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Finds this site's recent changes, for DELTA on another site to copy.</td></tr>\n</table>"
        },
        "date": 1791172772923,
        "after": "10e9b8d64200b8e8"
      },
      {
        "type": "add",
        "id": "47c3771024b56af9",
        "item": {
          "type": "markdown",
          "id": "47c3771024b56af9",
          "text": "## Inside PLUGIN rcn"
        },
        "date": 1791172772924,
        "after": "5213225fe3b9024c"
      },
      {
        "type": "add",
        "id": "09049ffe1a7a97eb",
        "item": {
          "type": "markdown",
          "id": "09049ffe1a7a97eb",
          "text": "These come with the Mech Blocks plugin, not with Mech itself, and read RCN data held on the same site."
        },
        "date": 1791172772925,
        "after": "47c3771024b56af9"
      },
      {
        "type": "add",
        "id": "aca94caf95b4b8bd",
        "item": {
          "type": "html",
          "id": "aca94caf95b4b8bd",
          "text": "<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr><th style=\"width:1%;white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">Block</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">What it does</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">PROJECTIONS</td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Lists the Layer 1 folders on this site.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">PROJECTION</td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Turns one Layer 1 folder into graphs, keeping only the kinds named after it.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">BADGES</td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Gathers the SODOTO badges on this site's pages, as people and the skills they hold.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">HELLO</td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Shows that the rcn plugin answers.</td></tr>\n</table>"
        },
        "date": 1791172772926,
        "after": "09049ffe1a7a97eb"
      },
      {
        "type": "add",
        "id": "5b40819bec3d74af",
        "item": {
          "type": "markdown",
          "id": "5b40819bec3d74af",
          "text": "CODE and DOWNLOAD have no pages in Ward's handbook yet; drafts of both are written and waiting to be offered to him. Every block, with what it needs and what it makes, is in the [[Mech Blocks Reference]]."
        },
        "date": 1791172772927,
        "after": "aca94caf95b4b8bd"
      },
      {
        "type": "add",
        "id": "9624641712b8851c",
        "item": {
          "type": "markdown",
          "id": "9624641712b8851c",
          "text": "*Marc Pierson and Claude Opus 5.5 · October 2026*",
          "attribution": true
        },
        "date": 1791172772945,
        "after": "b08d3e54e18fa3de"
      }
    ]
  }
}